{"unit_id":"log-li__dsh-automode#card-zh","repo":"log-li/dsh-automode","commit":"235f6b0a465c54123f2ad88ad4304a9ea3d12aef","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-automode 是面向 DSH 的自动工具调用审查插件，通过注入命令、审批处理器和工具执行前闸门接入会话。它先按确定性规则处理调用，再将其余操作交给两阶段分类器，并提供会话级 auto 模式、自动状态诊断、系统提示说明和审计记录。插件还可在权限选择器中加入 Auto mode 预设，支持配置允许或拒绝规则及信任路径。适合希望减少常规操作确认、同时保留自动审查流程的 DSH 用户；使用 DSH 插件管理命令安装，无需额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:470-570","src/pre-execute.ts:147-190","cordis.patch.yml:1-16"]}
{"unit_id":"log-li__dsh-automode#card-en","repo":"log-li/dsh-automode","commit":"235f6b0a465c54123f2ad88ad4304a9ea3d12aef","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-automode reviews DSH tool calls with rules and a two-stage classifier. It adds an auto-mode preset, configurable trusted paths, session diagnostics, and decision logging. Use /auto to enable it and /auto-status to inspect it. Install with the DSH plugin command.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:470-570","src/pre-execute.ts:147-190","cordis.patch.yml:1-16"]}
